{"id":3,"date":"2025-12-25T02:58:09","date_gmt":"2025-12-25T02:58:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/?page_id=3"},"modified":"2026-03-13T02:55:59","modified_gmt":"2026-03-13T02:55:59","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last Updated:\u200b\u200b 2025\/01\/18<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u200bCompany:\u200b\u200b Guangzhou Qianlan Biotechnology Co., Ltd. (\u201cQianlan\u201d, \u201cwe\u201d, \u201cus\u201d, or \u201cour\u201d)<br>\u200bWebsite:\u200b\u200b https:\/\/www.theshampoofactory.com<br>\u200bContact Email:\u200b\u200b sales@theshampoofactory.com<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-1-introduction\">\u200b1. Introduction\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Guangzhou Shampoo Factory is a leading OEM\/ODM shampoo manufacturer. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal information when you visit our website (theshampoofactory.com), place orders, or interact with our services. By using our services, you consent to the practices described herein.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-2-information-we-collect\">\u200b2. Information We Collect<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We may collect the following information when you browse our website, request quotes, place orders, or contact customer support:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Identifiers:\u200b\u200b Name, email address, phone number, shipping\/billing address.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bCommercial Information:\u200b\u200b Order history, product preferences, payment details (processed securely via third-party gateways; we do not store full credit card numbers).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bTechnical Data:\u200b\u200b IP address, browser type, device information, cookies (see Section 5), and website usage patterns (e.g., pages visited).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-3-how-we-use-your-information\">\u200b3. How We Use Your Information\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your data is used for the following purposes:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\u200bOrder Processing:\u200b\u200b Fulfilling purchases, shipping products, and providing invoices.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bCustomer Support:\u200b\u200b Responding to inquiries, complaints, or warranty requests.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bCommunication:\u200b\u200b Sending order updates, promotional offers (with consent), and service notices.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bImprovement:\u200b\u200b Analyzing website traffic to enhance user experience and product offerings.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bLegal Compliance:\u200b\u200b Meeting regulatory obligations (e.g., tax, accounting).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-4-legal-basis-for-processing\">4. Legal Basis for Processing\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We process your data based on:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Your explicit consent (e.g., for marketing emails).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Necessity to perform a contract (e.g., processing orders).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Legitimate business interests (e.g., website optimization).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Legal requirements (e.g., fraud prevention).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-5-cookies-and-tracking-technologies\">5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We use cookies to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Remember user preferences (e.g., language).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analyze traffic via tools like Google Analytics (anonymized data).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enable shopping cart functionality.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>You may disable cookies via browser settings, but some website features may be limited.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-6-data-sharing-and-disclosure\">6. Data Sharing and Disclosure\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We only share your information with:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Service Providers:\u200b\u200b Logistics partners (e.g., DHL, FedEx), payment processors (e.g., PayPal, Stripe), and IT support vendors (under strict confidentiality agreements).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bLegal Authorities:\u200b\u200b If required by law or to protect our rights (e.g., fraud investigation).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bBusiness Transfers:\u200b\u200b In case of merger, acquisition, or asset sale (with prior notice).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bWe do not sell your personal data to third parties.\u200b\u200b<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-7-data-retention\">7. Data Retention\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We retain your information only as long as necessary:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Order records: 6 years (for tax\/compliance purposes).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Marketing lists: Until consent is withdrawn (unsubscribe link in all emails).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Inactive accounts: Deleted after 2 years of inactivity.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-8-data-security\">8. Data Security\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We implement safeguards including:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SSL encryption for data transmission.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Secure servers with restricted access.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Regular security audits.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>While we strive to protect your data, no online system is 100% secure.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-9-your-rights\">9. Your Rights\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Under PIPL and GDPR (if applicable), you may:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Access or request a copy of your personal data.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Correct inaccuracies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Delete data or withdraw consent (e.g., unsubscribe from emails).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Restrict processing under certain conditions.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>To exercise these rights, contact us at sales@theshampoofactory.com. We will respond within 30 days.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-10-international-data-transfers\">10. International Data Transfers\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your data may be transferred to and processed in countries outside your residence (e.g., cloud servers in the US). We ensure such transfers comply with applicable laws (e.g., PIPL cross-border rules).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-11-children-s-privacy\">\u200b11. Children\u2019s Privacy\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our services are not directed to individuals under 16. We do not knowingly collect their data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-12-third-party-links\">\u200b12. Third-Party Links\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our website may link to external sites (e.g., social media, partner websites). This Privacy Policy does not apply to those sites\u2014review their policies separately.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-13-changes-to-this-policy\">\u200b13. Changes to This Policy\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We may update this policy periodically. The latest version will be posted on our website with a revised \u201cLast Updated\u201d date.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-14-contact-us\">\u200b14. Contact Us\u200b<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For questions, data requests, or complaints:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\u200bEmail:\u200b\u200b sales@theshampoofactory.com<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>\u200bPostal Address:\u200b\u200b Building 06, No.740, Helong 1st Road, Baiyun District, Guangzhou, Guangdong<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Last Updated:\u200b\u200b 2025\/01\/18 \u200bCompany:\u200b\u200b Guangzh